<view class="page"><view class="title">每日目标</view><view class="notice">修改从下一个本地日期生效，今天与历史记录不变。</view><picker range="{{modeLabels}}" value="{{modeIndex}}" bindchange="mode"><view class="field">目标模式：{{modeLabels[modeIndex]}}</view></picker><block wx:if="{{mode === 'automatic'}}"><picker range="{{objectiveLabels}}" value="{{objectiveIndex}}" bindchange="objective"><view class="field">当前目标：{{objectiveLabels[objectiveIndex]}}</view></picker><picker wx:if="{{objective !== 'maintain'}}" range="{{paceLabels}}" value="{{paceIndex}}" bindchange="pace"><view class="field">速度：{{paceLabels[paceIndex]}}</view></picker></block><block wx:else><label class="field"><text>热量：</text><input class="field-value" type="digit" value="{{manual.energyKcal}}" data-field="energyKcal" bindinput="manual"/><text>千卡</text></label><label class="field"><text>蛋白质：</text><input class="field-value" type="digit" value="{{manual.proteinGrams}}" data-field="proteinGrams" bindinput="manual"/><text>克</text></label><label class="field"><text>碳水：</text><input class="field-value" type="digit" value="{{manual.carbGrams}}" data-field="carbGrams" bindinput="manual"/><text>克</text></label><label class="field"><text>脂肪：</text><input class="field-value" type="digit" value="{{manual.fatGrams}}" data-field="fatGrams" bindinput="manual"/><text>克</text></label></block><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="preview">预览修改</button><view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="result"><view>{{preview.effectiveFrom}} 生效</view><view>{{preview.target.energyKcal}} 千卡 · 蛋白质 {{preview.target.proteinGrams}}g · 碳水 {{preview.target.carbGrams}}g · 脂肪 {{preview.target.fatGrams}}g</view><button type="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">确认保存</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="success">{{message}}</view></view>
